{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "New Interests and Aspirations", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Vanessa's Career Move", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "  Future Time Clauses:  Before, After", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "  You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the words <span class=\"italic\">If</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">When</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">Before</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> After</span> in time clauses.<br/>Future time clauses explain what needs to happen or which condition needs to be satisfied before a future event can occur.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/> <ul>If/When/Before/After + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + will/be going to + Simple Present tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before</span> means at an earlier time. An action in the future needs to be completed before the action introduced by the time clause can occur. <br/> Example: <br/> <ul> <span class=\"italic\">Before I tell you what my aspirations are, I want to say that I find mindfulness very useful.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> After</span> means at a later time. The action introduced by the time clause will lead to another action right after it is completed. <br/> Example: <br/>  <ul><span class=\"italic\">After you share your presentation, we will have a little celebration.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ...<br> Example: <ul><span class=\"italic\"> If I'm late again, I am going to lose my job. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> means at the time of doing something. <br> Example: <ul><span class=\"italic\"> When Julie gets here, we'll ask her what she thinks.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you leave here today, I know you will each have what it takes to reach your ultimate goals. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "After you share your presentations, we will have a small ceremony and reception to celebrate the completion of this course.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will register for the certificate when this course ends today!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Using Sequencing Connectors to  Explain and Support Your Ideas", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use contrast connectors to express your position and to show another point of view. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Connectors can show a connection to what you want to say and what was said before. They can also show your position and opinion on a particular situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Sequencing connectors are usually placed at the beginning of a sentence and provide a logical sequence between statements, or provide a link with a previous statement or sentence.  <br/><br/> Structure:  <br/><ul><span class=\"italic\"> Initial Sentence. <span class=\"strong\">Sequencing Connector</span>, + phrase. <span class=\"strong\">Sequencing connector</span>, etc.</span></ul> <br/>Look at the chart for some common sequencing connectors:<br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Sequencing Connector\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Sequencing Connector\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" first/firstly, first of all\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" For one thing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" second/secondly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" In addition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" third, in the third place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Furthermore\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" also\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Moreover\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" besides\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Finally\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " For one thing, you have proven that you are all courageous, dynamic and unique individuals.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " In addition, I've achieved a deeper level of honesty and discovered what my true hopes are. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Moreover, learning to meditate allowed me to peer into my soul.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Finally, I also realized something surprising: I have decided I would like to start a family within the next five years. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fulfilling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making you \u200bfeel \u200bhappy and \u200bsatisfied", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Working with you over the past week has been a fulfilling experience for me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about presentations.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to reap the benefits", "type": "name"}, {"content": "what you gain after your hard labor put in", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hope you all reap the benefits of your experiences here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "individual", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a \u200bsingle \u200bperson or thing, \u200bespecially when \u200bcompared to the \u200bgroup or set to which they \u200bbelong", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are all courageous, dynamic and unique individuals. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tremendous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very \u200bgreat in \u200bamount or \u200blevel, or \u200bextremely good", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The past week has given me tremendous insight into the way I think.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to peer into ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look very carefully into something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In particular, learning to meditate allowed me to peer into my soul.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hinder ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200blimit the \u200bability of someone to do something, or to \u200blimit the \u200bdevelopment of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I discovered the lies and fears that have hindered me from taking the next step.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to admit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200bagree that something is \u200btrue, \u200bespecially \u200bunwillingly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I admitted to myself that I am quite driven.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"ty