], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le04ob05re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nPlan your future!\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Working with you over the past week has been a fulfilling experience for me, and I hope you all reap the benefits  of your experiences here. For one thing, you have proven that you are all courageous, dynamic and unique  individuals. When you leave here today, I know you will each have what it takes to reach your ultimate goals. After you share your presentations, we will have a small ceremony and reception to celebrate the completion of this course. Let's begin the presentations with Vanessa.", "id": 1, "time": "200", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi everyone. To start with, I'd like to thank you, Amy, and each one of you in this room for being incredibly inspirational. The past week has given me tremendous insight into the way I think. In addition, I've achieved a deeper level of honesty and discovered what my true hopes are. Before I tell you what my aspirations are, I want to say that the most useful session for me was the one on mindfulness.", "id": 2, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"></span>Moreover, learning to meditate allowed me to peer into my soul and discover the lies and fears that have hindered me from taking the next step. I have defined three clear objectives. The most immediate one is that I want return to school to get a restaurant management certificate. Finally, I also realized something surprising: I have decided I would like to start a family within the next five to seven years! I admitted to myself that I am quite driven and have a picture of what happiness and success is for me. My third objective is to create, own, and manage my own gourmet restaurant. I will register for the certificate when this course ends today!", "id": 3, "time": "59000", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le04ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le04ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}